* PVCELL VDMOS C_gd fit for MSC035SMA170B4: drain ramp 0..850 V, gate held at -4.0 V
.model m VDMOS(Vto=3.2 Kp=6.25 lambda=0.01 Rd=0.02448 Rs=0.5m Rg=0.85 Cgs=3.287e-09 Cgdmax=6.6e-10 Cgdmin=1.3e-11 a=0.07466 Cjo=2.596e-09 Vj=3 M=0.5 Is=7.58e-16 N=3 Rb=0.03121 Tt=0)
Vg g 0 -4.0
Vd dd 0 PWL(0 0 10u 850.0)
Rd dd dn 1m
M1 dn g 0 m
.save i(Vg) v(dn)
.tran 5n 10u
.control
run
wrdata pv_fit_MSC035SMA170B4.dat i(Vg) v(dn)
quit
.endc
.end
